  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba Satana aimine abena Israeli no kutunka Davidi ukuti apende abena Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi Davidi epakweba Yoabu na bakalamba ba fita fyankondo ati, “Kabiyeni, kapendeni abena Israeli ukufuma ku Beresheba ukufika ku Dani. Mwise munjebe pakuti njise njishibe ifyo bali.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Yoabu ayasuka imfumu ati, “Nacibe ukuti Yawe asandulule ubwingi bwa bashilika imiku umwanda umo (100) ukucila ifyo bali. Lelo, mwe shikulu imfumu yandi, bushe bonse aba te babomfi ba mfumu? Cinshi kanshi calenga ukuti shikulu acite icintu ca musango uyu? Mulandu nshi uwalenga alete umulandu pali Israeli?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo icebo ca mfumu capula pa cebo cakwa Yoabu. Kanshi Yoabu epakwima no kupitana mu calo conse ica Israeli no kubwelulukila ku Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Yoabu aisa sosa impendwa ya bashilika kuli Davidi. Mu calo conse ica Israeli mwali umuntapendwa umo na makana umwanda umo (1,100,000) abaume abengabomfya ulupanga pakulwa, ukulundapo na bambi amakana imyanda ine na makumi cine lubali (470,000) abali mu Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo Yoabu tasanshisheko abena Levi na bena Benjamini pakupenda, pa mulandu wakuti ifunde lyapeele imfumu talyali lyakusekesha Yoabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ili line ifunde lyali ilyabubifi pa cinso cakwa Lesa, nao epakukanda Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Davidi asosa kuli Lesa ati, “Ine nimbifya apakalamba paco ncitile. Nomba kanshi, nakupapata, fumya umulandu uyu pa mubomfi obe, pantu nincita icintu icabulamo amano nganshi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe aeba Gadi kamona wakwa Davidi ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kabiye kebe Davidi auti, ifi efyo Yawe asosa ati, ‘Nalakupeela ifya kusalapo fitatu. Salapo cimo ico ulefwaya, ico mfwile ukucita kuli iwe.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi Gadi epakuya kuli Davidi no kumweba ati, “Ifi efyo Yawe asosa ati, ‘Isalile we mwine, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "napamo imyaka itatu iya cipowe, nangu imyeshi itatu iyakonaulwa ku balwani bobe ilyo ulupanga lwabo lukakusanga, nangu inshiku shitatu ku lupanga lwakwa Yawe, nangu inshiku isha cikuko mu calo, ilyo malaika wakwa Yawe alepitamo mukonaula incende shonse isha mu Israeli. Nomba iwe tontonkanya ifyo ndeya eba uuntumine.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Davidi ayasuka Gadi ati, “Awe kwena ndi uwacucutika nganshi. Kanshi ndekenifye mponene mu minwe yakwa Yawe, pantu uluse lwakwe lukalamba nganshi. Lelo mwileka mponene mu minwe ya bantunse.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi Yawe epakutuma icikuko pa bena Israeli na bantu abaume amakana cine lubali (70,000) bafwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Lesa atuma malaika mukonaula Yerusalemu. Ilyo malaika aleonaula, Yawe amonako no kumfwa bulanda pa mulandu wa cikuko, elyo aeba malaika uwaleonaula ati, “Capwa! Bwesha ukuboko kobe.” Malaika wakwa Yawe ninshi eminine pa lubansa lwakutwilapo ulwakwa Arauna umwina Yebusi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi ainwina amenso mu mulu elyo amona malaika wakwa Yawe naiminina pakati ka mulu ne sonde, ninshi napambula ulupanga mu minwe yakwe pa musumba wa Yerusalemu. Elyo Davidi na bakalamba bafwala insalu shabulanda bawa panshi ubukupeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi nao asosa kuli Lesa ati, “Bushe teine wapeele ifunde lyakupenda abaume babulwi? Ninefye ncitile icabubifi no kulufyanya. Aba bonse bena ni mpaangafye. Ni finshi bacitile? We Yawe Lesa wandi, uleke ukuboko kobe kuponene pali ine na ba ŋanda yandi, lelo wileka ici cibe pa bantu bobe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo malaika wakwa Yawe apeele Gadi icipope cakweba Davidi ukwima no kuya kuula ubulambo bwakwa Yawe pa lubansa lwakutwilapo ulwakwa Arauna umwina Yebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi Davidi epakuya mukumfwila ishiwi ilyo Gadi asosele mwishina lyakwa Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo Arauna acili aletwa iŋanu, ati apilibuke amona malaika. Na bana bakwe abaume abo ali nabo bafumapo baya belama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lintu Davidi apalama, elyo Arauna alolesha no kumumona, afuma apo aletwila no kuya kontama pa cinso cakwa Davidi, ashimpa ne mpumi panshi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Davidi aeba Arauna ati, “Mpeela ulo lubansa lobe ulwakutwilapo pakuti nkuulepo ubulambo bwakwa Yawe, pakuti icikuko icili pa bantu cipwe. Nshitisha pa mutengo uutuntulu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo Arauna aeba Davidi ati, “Buulafye we mwine, leka shikulu imfumu yandi icite icili conse icalaiwamina ku menso yaiko. Moneni, nalapeela iŋombe ishe lambo lyakoca, imilando yakutwilako eyo ibe inkuni elyo ne ŋanu sha mutuulo wa cabunga. Awe nalapeela fyonse.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo imfumu Davidi yayasuka Arauna aiti, “Iyo, ine ndefwayafye ukulipila umutengo uutuntulu. Pantu nshilefwaya ukutwalila Yawe ifintu fyobe, nangu ukutuula ilambo lyakoca ilyo nshiposelepo nangu cimo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi Davidi epakulipila Arauna indalama amashekeli imyanda mutanda (600)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21:25",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Amashekeli 600:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ekutila amakilo cine lubali.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " isha golide pali ilya ncende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Palya pene epo Davidi akuula ubulambo bwakwa Yawe, atuula na malambo yakoca na malambo yakwampana. Elyo Davidi apepa na kuli Yawe, na Yawe amwasuka, no mulilo wafuma ku mulu ukwisa pa bulambo bwa mutuulo wakoca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Yawe aeba malaika, nao abweseshe ulupanga mu citubo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa nshita ine ilya, ilyo Davidi amona ukuti Yawe amwasuka pa lubansa lwakutwilapo lwakwa Arauna umwina Yebusi, awe atuulilapo na malambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itenti lyakwa Yawe, lilya Mose apangile mu matololo, elyo no bulambo bwakocelapo pali ilya nshita fyali pa ncende yakupepelapo iyo balecindika ku Gibeoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo Davidi alifililwe ukuya pantanshi ye Tenti kukwipusha kuli Lesa, pantu atiinine ulupanga lwakwa malaika wakwa Yawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
